NOTE ON spec/corpus/

That directory contains pages fetched verbatim from Razorpay's public
documentation (https://razorpay.com/docs/build/llm-docs/), retained so that the
G1-GROUNDED gate can verify every quoted sentence byte-for-byte against the
source it claims. Those pages are Razorpay's copyrighted material, are not
covered by the MIT grant above, and are included here as a fetched evidence
corpus rather than as part of this software. Each is re-fetchable with
`python harness/specmine.py --fetch`.
